  ('ffdb6d3f-7942-5253-bfdb-37617521a353', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g10-figurative-language'), null, 'medium',
   $q$Ifeoma speaks "as calmly as a pilot reporting light turbulence." What does this simile emphasize?$q$, $q$[{"text":"She is secretly frightened and cannot hide it from the cast.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"She treats a stressful moment as routine so that others stay steady.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Ifeoma once worked as a pilot before joining the theater crew.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"literal-reading"},{"text":"The auditorium was shaking because of a storm outside.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-target"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$She treats a stressful moment as routine so that others stay steady.$q$, $q$Pilots reporting turbulence sound steady to reassure passengers, and Ifeoma's calm tone makes "a few people" laugh. The thunder in the passage is a sound effect, not a real storm, so the storm reading misreads the comparison.$q$, 'draft', '621ead57-d96b-532a-8dc5-8ef6ef0fc115')
