-- Passage rg10-literary-structure-pov-p02
insert into public.passages (id, code, skill_id, sat_alignment, grade_band, title, body, status)
values ('7cd89c4b-d65a-50e6-8683-4025c04e8e58', 'rg10-literary-structure-pov-p02', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g10-literary-structure-pov'), null,
        '9-12', $q$Two Clocks$q$, $q$9:02 a.m., Riverside High School parking lot. Priya Raman checked the knot on the parachute line for the fourth time. The weather balloon swelled above her like a white planet, tugging at the rope in Mateo's gloved hands. Inside the foam box hung a camera, a thermometer and a tracker that would, if everything worked, report where the box came down. "Ready," said Ms. Ellery, and Mateo let go.

9:02 a.m., a soybean farm sixty miles east. Priya's grandfather, Arun, sat at the kitchen table with a laptop he had owned for exactly six days. Priya had installed the tracking map for him and written the steps on an index card. He read the card again, clicked the wrong button, and watched the screen go gray.

10:40 a.m., the parking lot. The class crowded around Ms. Ellery's tablet. The balloon had climbed past eighty thousand feet. The tiny dot on the map drifted east, then farther east. Priya felt her stomach tighten. The wind was stronger than the forecast had promised.

10:40 a.m., the farm. Arun had found the map again. A small red dot was moving across it, and it was moving toward him. He put on his boots.

11:55 a.m., the parking lot. The tracker had gone silent. "It happens," Ms. Ellery said, but her voice was careful. Priya stared at the last known position, a blank field near a county road she almost recognized.

11:55 a.m., a soybean field. Something orange flapped above the stubble. Arun walked toward it, slowly, the way he once walked toward a calf that might run. The foam box sat upright in the dirt, its camera still blinking.

At 12:10, Priya's phone rang. She did not know the photo that appeared on her screen, because her grandfather had never sent her a photo before. It showed a parachute, a foam box, and the toe of a muddy boot.$q$, 'draft')
