   $q$What does the speaker reveal about the speaker's role by saying "I trim the part / that sounds impatient. I add a please she did not say"?$q$, $q$[{"text":"The speaker wants the clerk to seem rude so the father will leave the office.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"reverses-meaning"},{"text":"The speaker shapes the conversation, softening it to protect the father's feelings.","is_correct":true},{"text":"The speaker translates every word exactly, without changing anything either person says.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"The speaker does not understand the clerk's English and guesses at its meaning.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$The speaker shapes the conversation, softening it to protect the father's feelings.$q$, $q$Removing impatience and adding a polite "please" shows the speaker edits the words to make the exchange kinder. The lines directly say the speaker changes things, so exact translation is ruled out.$q$, 'draft', 'ba38fac0-98d2-578f-91aa-780c67c15e31')
