   $q$Which is the best objective summary of the passage?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Because many night migrants fly past unseen, researchers record their calls. A Harrowgate study detected birds morning counts missed, and though sound must be combined with other data, the results now guide efforts to protect birds.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Microphones are an amazing tool that every town should install. Harrowgate's clever team proved that listening is far better than any other method, and other cities are foolish not to copy it.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"includes-opinion"},{"text":"Songbirds migrate at night to avoid predators. Researchers in Harrowgate found that bright buildings kill most migrating birds, so the town turned off all of its lights for the season.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"Harrowgate placed twelve rooftop microphones across the region. Over three autumns they recorded more than forty thousand calls from at least thirty different species of birds.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Because many night migrants fly past unseen, researchers record their calls. A Harrowgate study detected birds morning counts missed, and though sound must be combined with other data, the results now guide efforts to protect birds.$q$, $q$The summary beginning "Because many night migrants fly past unseen" covers the method, the evidence, the limits and the result without adding judgments. The summary beginning "Harrowgate placed twelve rooftop microphones" is accurate but leaves out why listening matters and what it changed.$q$, 'draft', 'd7e45505-307c-5593-ba89-29005b3e5902')
