   $q$What does Priya's added second sentence, and the time she spends on it, most strongly suggest?$q$, $q$[{"text":"She is following Ms. Achebe's instruction to explain the change in data.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"She finds writing difficult and struggles with even short catalog notes.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"She now cares about the work and wants Hester's role recorded accurately.","is_correct":true},{"text":"She wants to finish quickly so she can return to scanning envelopes.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$She now cares about the work and wants Hester's role recorded accurately.$q$, $q$Ms. Achebe asked only for a note on who kept which pages; Priya chose to add the reason the data grew more precise and spent longer on it than on anything else there. Since the second sentence was her own addition, it was not an instruction she was following.$q$, 'draft', '159dae90-fd07-5b66-9a26-5393df1ab587')
