   $q$According to the passage, how much time did each player have left at move forty?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Mei had one minute and Lorenzo had six.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-detail"},{"text":"Mei had four minutes and Lorenzo had twelve.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"reverses-detail"},{"text":"Each player had about twelve minutes left.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-detail"},{"text":"Mei had twelve minutes and Lorenzo had four.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Mei had twelve minutes and Lorenzo had four.$q$, $q$The third paragraph says "Mei had twelve minutes left on her clock to his four." The reversed choice swaps the two players, which would undo the whole ending.$q$, 'draft', '0ba977b6-b0ef-5ef9-9e77-8f888d269a25')
