   $q$Which lines best support the idea that the speaker's contribution goes unseen?$q$, $q$[{"text":"\"Marisol takes it clean.\"","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"irrelevant-evidence"},{"text":"\"I take the baton from Dev, / still warm from his hand\"","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"irrelevant-evidence"},{"text":"\"and I carry it through the bend / where no camera ever points\"","is_correct":true},{"text":"\"I count my steps the way Coach taught us\"","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"irrelevant-evidence"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$"and I carry it through the bend / where no camera ever points"$q$, $q$The bend "where no camera ever points" directly states that no one records the speaker's part of the race. The lines about Dev's warm baton, Coach's step counting, and Marisol's clean catch describe handoffs and technique but say nothing about being unseen.$q$, 'draft', '867c859c-b4a3-5d8e-928b-72a4870b9830')
