  ('75c251e0-524d-530f-b662-8dbdd750e556', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g10-theme-summary'), null, 'hard',
   $q$How does Mateo's final thought, that he may have "translated his father into someone smaller," refine the theme?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It reveals that Mateo blames Ms. Halvorsen for not understanding his father's Spanish.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"It suggests that Mateo now believes his father should learn to speak only in English.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"It shows that Mateo has decided to stop translating for his father in the future.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"It shows he sees that his edits, though meant to help, had hidden who his father truly is.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It shows he sees that his edits, though meant to help, had hidden who his father truly is.$q$, $q$Mateo had believed trimming made his father "sound impressive," and now recognizes the trimming cut away what made his father's answer powerful. Nothing suggests he will stop translating; he questions how he translates, not whether.$q$, 'draft', '449bc0cf-0735-56ec-90ec-03e29a31c04d')
