   $q$What evidence supports the author's claim that removing the dam is the cheaper choice?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Staged removals on other rivers that kept sediment problems minor.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"mismatched-reason"},{"text":"State wildlife surveys counting only a few hundred herring below the dam.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"mismatched-reason"},{"text":"Mill records showing that farmers once used herring as fertilizer.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"mismatched-reason"},{"text":"An engineering report estimating repairs at $4.2 million and removal at $3.1 million.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$An engineering report estimating repairs at $4.2 million and removal at $3.1 million.$q$, $q$The third paragraph compares the report's repair and removal estimates directly. The herring surveys support the reason about fish, not cost.$q$, 'draft', 'a47257cb-f78c-53a9-b4a7-ef798e743513')
