   $q$What flaw does the writer find in the reasoning behind the district's plan?$q$, $q$[{"text":"The district reported the chess club test scores inaccurately.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"The district treats a link between chess and scores as proof of cause.","is_correct":true},{"text":"The district compared chess players with students in art classes.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-studies"},{"text":"The district studied too few students to see any difference.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$The district treats a link between chess and scores as proof of cause.$q$, $q$The writer says "The finding is real" but that it "does not show that chess is the reason." The comparison with an art period comes from the Okonkwo study, not the district.$q$, 'draft', '770035f2-3fb5-5569-bc1c-d7534f7225a2')
