  ('0bb6be48-004b-58fa-aa67-1c569bacda7a', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g11-authors-purpose'), null, 'medium',
   $q$What is the effect of the series of people described in the third paragraph (the older man, the mother, the teenager, the worker)?$q$, $q$[{"text":"The varied, concrete portraits give a dry budget item human faces and show that benches serve many kinds of residents.","is_correct":true},{"text":"The varied portraits describe a single afternoon the speaker spent downtown, which explains how the speaker first noticed the lack of benches.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-anecdote"},{"text":"The varied portraits show that only older residents truly need benches, which narrows the request to the area near the pharmacy.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"},{"text":"The varied portraits identify the committee members by their jobs, which suggests that each one has a personal interest in benches.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$The varied, concrete portraits give a dry budget item human faces and show that benches serve many kinds of residents.$q$, $q$The speaker introduces the list with "consider who actually needs a place to sit," and the range of ages and situations shows broad need. The examples include a mother, a teenager, and a worker, so the need is not limited to older residents.$q$, 'draft', '4b8fd98d-207e-59f4-8602-08897cb27068')
